#. Description of the plugin
#: soderlind-json-ld.php
msgid "AI-optimized JSON-LD structured data for WordPress. Auto-detects content patterns and outputs schema.org markup via @graph for maximum AI search visibility."
msgstr "AI-optimalisert JSON-LD strukturerte data for WordPress. Oppdager innholdsmønstre automatisk og gir ut schema.org-markering via @graph for maksimal synlighet i AI-søk."

